":"நள்","lemma":"நள்","gloss":"middle/deep"},{"text":"இருள்","lemma":"இருள்","gloss":"darkness"}],"gloss":"deep darkness"},{"surface":"யாமத்து","parts":[{"text":"யாமத்து","lemma":"யாமம்","gloss":"midnight"}],"gloss":"of midnight"},{"surface":"இல்லெலி","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"},{"text":"எலி","lemma":"எலி","gloss":"rat"}],"gloss":"house rat"},{"surface":"பார்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பார்க்கும்","lemma":"பார்","gloss":"watch"}],"gloss":"watching"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிள்ளை","parts":[{"text":"பிள்ளை","lemma":"பிள்ளை","gloss":"young"}],"gloss":"young"},{"surface":"வெருகிற்கு","parts":[{"text":"வெருகு","lemma":"வெருகு","gloss":"wildcat"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique marker"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative suffix"}],"gloss":"to the wildcat"},{"surface":"அல்கு","parts":[{"text":"அல்கு","lemma":"அல்கு","gloss":"night/staying"}],"gloss":"night"},{"surface":"இரை","parts":[{"text":"இரை","lemma":"இரை","gloss":"prey"}],"gloss":"prey"},{"surface":"ஆகி","parts":[{"text":"ஆகி","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"}],"gloss":"becoming"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடுநவை","parts":[{"text":"கடு","lemma":"கடு","gloss":"severe"},{"text":"நவை","lemma":"நவை","gloss":"distress"}],"gloss":"severe distress"},{"surface":"படீஇயரோ","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"ஈஇயர்","lemma":"இயர்","gloss":"optative suffix"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"particle"}],"gloss":"may you suffer!"},{"surface":"நீயே","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you indeed"},{"surface":"நெடுநீர்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"deep/vast"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"deep water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாணர்","parts":[{"text":"யாணர்","lemma":"யாணர்","gloss":"fertility"}],"gloss":"fertile"},{"surface":"ஊரன்","parts":[{"text":"ஊரன்","lemma":"ஊரன்","gloss":"chief of the town"}],"gloss":"chief of the town"},{"surface":"தன்னொடு","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"himself"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with him"},{"surface":"வதிந்த","parts":[{"text":"வதி","lemma":"வதி","gloss":"stay/sleep"},{"text":"ந்த","lemma":"அ","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"slept"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏம","parts":[{"text":"ஏம","lemma":"ஏம","gloss":"secure"}],"gloss":"secure","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இன்துயில்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"துயில்","lemma":"துயில்","gloss":"sleep"}],"gloss":"sweet sleep"},{"surface":"எடுப்பியோயே","parts":[{"text":"எடுப்பு","lemma":"எடுப்பு","gloss":"cause to wake"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"ஓய்","lemma":"ஓய்","gloss":"you (singular)"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"O you who woke [us] up!"}]}],"literal":"Like the bright flower of the glory lily with bunched clusters, / the rooster with a dense red crest and a flock / watching for house rats in the deep darkness of midnight, / becoming the night prey for the young wildcat, / may you suffer severe distress! You indeed, / who woke us from the sweet, secure sleep with the chief of the fertile, watery town!","translation":"O rooster with a dense red crest, resembling the bright flower of the clustered glory lily! You who lead a flock and watch for house rats in the deep darkness of midnight, only to become the night prey of a young wildcat—may you suffer severe distress! For you have woken me from my sweet, secure sleep with the lord of the fertile, watery town.","modern":"குவிந்த கொத்துக்களைக் கொண்ட தோன்றிப்பூவின் பிரகாசமான மலரைப் போன்ற அடர்ந்த சிவந்த கொண்டையையும், தன் கூட்டத்தையும் உடைய சேவலே! நள்ளிருள் யாமத்தில் வீட்டு எலிகளைப் பார்த்துக் கொண்டிருக்கும் நீ, இளமையான காட்டுப்பூனைக்கு இரவாகிப் போய், கடுமையான துன்பத்தை அடைவாயாக! நீர்வளம் மிக்க புதுவருவாய் உடைய ஊரனாகிய என் தலைவனுடன் நான் கூடிப் பெற்ற இன்பமான துயிலைக் கலைத்து எழுப்பியவனே!","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine (தலைவி), who is addressing a rooster in the Marutham (agricultural) landscape. She has spent a blissful night with her husband, the chief of the fertile town, but the rooster's crowing at dawn has woken them up and ended their sweet union. Frustrated by this interruption, she curses the rooster, wishing that it becomes prey to a young wildcat as it hunts for rats in the dark. The imagery of the rooster being hunted by a wildcat reflects the vulnerability of her own happiness, which is easily disrupted by external forces. Key words include 'இன்துயில்' (sweet sleep), 'ஊரன்' (chief of the town), and 'சேவல்' (rooster).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.4],[1.4,1.85],[1.85,2.23],[2.23,2.6],[2.6,2.8],[2.8,3.2],[3.2,4.5],[4.5,4.93],[4.93,5.3],[5.3,5.91],[5.91,6.27],[6.27,6.76],[6.76,7.25],[7.25,7.61],[7.61,8.22],[8.22,8.5],[8.5,10.8],[10.8,11.0],[11.0,11.9],[11.9,12.5],[12.5,13.3],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.47],[14.64,14.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.4],[1.45,1.6],[1.6,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,5.1],[5.1,5.46],[5.46,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.42],[6.42,6.97],[6.97,7.53],[7.53,7.91],[7.91,8.55],[8.55,8.8],[8.8,10.7],[10.7,10.9],[10.9,11.98],[11.98,12.7],[12.7,13.5],[13.5,14.0],[14.0,14.2],[14.2,14.84],[15.02,15.2]]},"sync":[[["குவி","bunched"],["இணர்","blossoms"]],[["தோன்றி","glory lily"]],[["ஒண்பூ","bright flower"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["தொகு","dense"],["செந்நெற்றி","red crest"]],[["செந்நெற்றி","red crest"],["கணங்கொள்","having a flock"]],[["கணங்கொள்","having a flock"]],[["சேவல்","rooster"]],[["நள்ளிருள்","deep darkness"]],[["யாமத்து","of midnight"]],[["யாமத்து","of midnight"],["இல்லெலி","house rat"]],[["பார்க்கும்","watching"]],[["பிள்ளை","young"]],[["வெருகிற்கு","to the wildcat"]],[["வெருகிற்கு","to the wildcat"],["அல்கு","night"],["இரை","prey"]],[["ஆகி","becoming"]],[["கடுநவை","severe distress"]],[["படீஇயரோ","may you suffer!"]],[["நீயே","you indeed"]],[["நெடுநீர்","deep water"]],[["யாணர்","fertile"],["ஊரன்","chief of the town"]],[["தன்னொடு","with him"]],[["வதிந்த","slept"]],[["ஏம","secure"]],[["இன்துயில்","sweet sleep"]],[["எடுப்பியோயே","O you who woke [us] up!"]],[["எடுப்பியோயே","O you who woke [us] up!"]]]}